      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is the abridged rhyming English translation by Katie Magnus for the piyyut “Aɐpid Nézer Ayom” by Elazar ben Qalir. The translation is found in Hebert Adler and Arthur Davis’s <tei:hi rend="italic">Maḥzor Avodat Ohel Moed: Avodat Yom haZikaron</tei:hi> (1907), pp. 102-103. I have set the translation as-is side-by-side with the text of Aɐpid to the best of my ability. A handful of verses are elided in Magnus’s translation. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_65966_notes"/>
